WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.158
No reply. Does that mean no care?

00:00:03.158 --> 00:00:06.316
A behavior appears. A story follows.

00:00:06.316 --> 00:00:09.474
Attribution asks how we explain behavior.

00:00:09.474 --> 00:00:12.632
The person is salient. Context is quieter.

00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:15.789
The tendency varies across tasks and cultures.

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:22.105
Late is an observation. Selfish is an inference.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:28.421
Separate them to open more questions.

00:00:28.421 --> 00:00:34.737
What did they know? What constrained them?

00:00:34.737 --> 00:00:41.053
Zoom out. More explanations may appear.

00:00:41.053 --> 00:00:44.211
A reason does not erase your waiting.

00:00:44.211 --> 00:00:47.368
Context and responsibility can coexist.

00:00:47.368 --> 00:00:50.526
Repeated patterns also matter.

00:00:50.526 --> 00:00:56.842
Name the impact. Ask what happened.

00:00:56.842 --> 00:01:03.158
Agree on how to communicate next time.

00:01:03.158 --> 00:01:06.316
This is fiction. Real causes need checking.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:09.474
Do not define a person by one moment.

00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:12.632
Understanding can include your own needs.

00:01:12.632 --> 00:01:15.789
Keep a window open for new information.
